       NM, 23-Mar-1995.) $)
    biorfi $p |- ( ps <-> ( ps \/ ph ) ) $=
      ( wn wo wb orc orel2 impbid2 ax-mp ) ADZBBAEZFCKBLBAGABHIJ $.
  $}

  $( Theorem *2.621 of [WhiteheadRussell] p. 107.  (Contributed by NM,
     3-Jan-2005.) $)
  pm2.621 $p |- ( ( ph -> ps ) -> ( ( ph \/ ps ) -> ps ) ) $=
