  pm4.62 $p |- ( ( ph -> -. ps ) <-> ( -. ph \/ -. ps ) ) $=
    ( wn imor ) ABCD $.

  $( Theorem *4.66 of [WhiteheadRussell] p. 120.  (Contributed by NM,
