  $( Express conjunction in terms of implication.  (Contributed by NM,
     2-Aug-1994.) $)
  annim $p |- ( ( ph /\ -. ps ) <-> -. ( ph -> ps ) ) $=
    ( wi wn wa iman con2bii ) ABCABDEABFG $.

  $( Theorem *4.61 of [WhiteheadRussell] p. 120.  (Contributed by NM,
