     specifically studying the latter's properties.  (Contributed by NM,
     21-May-2008.) $)
  ax6o $p |- ( -. A. x -. A. x ph -> ph ) $=
    ( wal wn sp ax-6 nsyl4 ) ABCZAHDBCABEABFG $.

  $( Abbreviated version of ~ ax6o .  (Contributed by NM, 5-Aug-1993.) $)
                                     
                                                          

