  $( Figure 3 $)

  ${
    $( Major premise for the Aristotelian syllogism "Datisi" $)
    datisi.maj $e |- A. x ( ph -> ps ) $.
    $( Minor premise for  $)
    datisi.min $e |- E. x ( ph /\ ch ) $.
    $( "Datisi", one of the syllogisms of Aristotelian logic.  All ` ph ` is
