  $}

  ${
    3eqtr2d.1 $e |- ( ph -> A = B ) $.
    3eqtr2d.2 $e |- ( ph -> C = B ) $.
    3eqtr2d.3 $e |- ( ph -> C = D ) $.
    $( A deduction from three chained equalities.  (Contributed by NM,
