    nfeqd $p |- ( ph -> F/ x A = B ) $=
      ( vy wceq cv wcel wb wal dfcleq nfv nfcrd nfbid nfald nfxfrd ) CDHGIZCJZS
      DJZKZGLABGCDMAUBBGAGNATUABABGCEOABGDFOPQR $.

    $( Hypothesis builder for elementhood.  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro,
