      IZFGZCJZAKZFISDJZBKZFIACLBDLUAUCABFTUBABRCDSEMNOAFCPBFDPQ $.

    $( Formula-building lemma for use with the Distinctor Reduction Theorem.
       (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 8-Oct-2016.) $)
                                                             
                                                                               
                                                                    
  $}

  ${
