    $( A way to say " ` A ` is a set" (inference rule).  (Contributed by NM,
       5-Aug-1993.) $)
    isseti $p |- E. x x = A $=
      ( cvv wcel cv wceq wex isset mpbi ) BDEAFBGAHCABIJ $.
  $}

  ${
