  Conventions
=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=

  This section describes the conventions we use.  These conventions often refer
  to existing mathematical practices, which are discussed in more detail in
  other references.

$)

  ${
