    conventions.1 $e |- ph $.
    $( Unless there is a reason to diverge, we follow the conventions of the
       Metamath Proof Explorer (MPE, set.mm).

       <HTML><ul><li><b>Community.</b>
       The Metamath mailing list also covers New Foundations set theory and is
