df-lnwcodes $a |- LNWCodes A = HWCN ~P A $.
$}

${
  $d c e R A $.
df-lnwiso $a |- LNWIso A = HWNIso ~P A $.
$}

${
  $d c e R A $.
df-lnwtypes $a |- LNWTypes A = ( LNWCodes A /. LNWIso A ) $.
$}

