   family bound.  The reverse-comparison realizer records the honest two-type
   cost of identifying a strict segment of HNOrd X with a well-ordered
   carrier a C_ X.  The final premise is exactly shifted Hartogs
   no-domination.  No choice, cardinal comparability, or strict family bound
   is hidden in this propositional/cardinal layer. $)
${
